# Onboarding Index

Startup-loaded entry point for the onboarding role.

Use this file as a thin router. Read only the role shards needed for the current task.

## Role Shards
- `experience.md` — durable onboarding findings, corrections, and workflow lessons.
- Additional role-local docs may live beside this index; read them only when the task needs that detail.

## Write Policy
- Keep this index short.
- Promote durable role findings into `experience.md` through pamem governance.

